  "wants_video": false,
  "ig_caption": "Your inbox isn't a to-do list.\n\nIt's a tax on your attention.\n\nI let Claude audit mine for a week.\n\nHere's what it did:\n\n→ Categorised 400+ emails by intent\n→ Drafted replies in my tone of voice\n→ Flagged the 12 that actually mattered\n→ Archived the noise automatically\n\nTotal time saved: 6 hours.\n\nIn one week.\n\nThat's a full workday back — every single month.\n\nStill triaging your inbox manually?\n\n#AIAutomation #ClaudeAI #GoogleWorkspace #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #WorkflowAutomation #AIAgents #Accelod #EmailAutomation #Productivity #AITools #SmallBusiness #Founders #TimeManagement #DigitalTransformation #AIForBusiness #Automation #StartupLife #TechTools #Efficiency #BusinessGrowth #Anthropic #InboxZero",
  "fb_caption": "Your inbox isn't a to-do list. It's a tax on your attention.\n\nI let Claude audit mine for a week.\n\nHere's what it did:\n\n→ Categorised 400+ emails by intent\n→ Drafted replies in my voice\n→ Flagged the 12 that actually mattered\n→ Archived the noise\n\nTotal time saved: 6 hours in one week.\n\nThat's a full workday back every month — just from email.\n\nHow many hours a week do you lose to your inbox?\n\n#AIAutomation #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #ClaudeAI",
